<title>SINGAPORE: Cycle &amp; Carriage to award S$86 contract.</title>
<headline>Cycle &amp; Carriage to award S$86 contract.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's Cycle &amp; Carriage Ltd said on Tuesday its subsidairy CCL Properties (Hillview) Pte Ltd was proposing to award a S$86 million construction contract to Gammon Pte Ltd.</p>
</text>
